---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for projectinsomnia.com.">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>

  <p>
    This site collects no information about you. No analytics, no tracking,
    no cookies, no accounts.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you email me, I have your email address and whatever you wrote. I use
    it to reply to you. That's it. I don't share it or sell it. If you want it
    deleted, email <a href="mailto:andrew@projectinsomnia.com">andrew@projectinsomnia.com</a>
    and I'll delete it.
  </p>

  <p>
    The site is hosted on <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Netlify</a>,
    which may keep standard server logs (such as IP addresses) like any web
    host. A few pages load images from third-party services, which see those
    requests the same way.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
